olor:#193e34;padding-left:8px;\">Legal</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card text\" style=\"background:#fffef7;border:1px solid #d9dfd3;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 28px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#193e34;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#193e34;\">You've been invited</h1>\n<p>You've been invited to join Rancher Legal. Accept the invitation to create your account.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;\"><tr><td class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#193e34;border-radius:8px;\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#fffef7;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\">Accept invitation</a></td></tr></table>\n<div class=\"muted\" style=\"color:#536059;\"><p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;\">If the button doesn't work, copy this link into your browser:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#536059;word-break:break-all;\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n<p class=\"rule\" style=\"margin:24px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd3;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#536059;\">If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can ignore this email.</p></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\" style=\"padding:20px 4px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#536059;\">Rancher Legal &middot; <a href=\"https://legal.gorancher.com\" style=\"color:#536059;\">legal.gorancher.com</a></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
