nt-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#193e34;padding-left:8px;\">Legal</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"card text\" style=\"background:#fffef7;border:1px solid #d9dfd3;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 28px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#193e34;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;color:#193e34;\">Your phone number was changed</h1>\n<p>The phone number for your Rancher Legal account was changed.</p>\n\n<div class=\"muted\" style=\"color:#536059;\">\n<p class=\"rule\" style=\"margin:24px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd3;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#536059;\">If you didn't make this change, contact your Rancher administrator right away.</p></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\" style=\"padding:20px 4px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#536059;\">Rancher Legal &middot; <a href=\"https://legal.gorancher.com\" style=\"color:#536059;\">legal.gorancher.com</a></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
